[style name="Interaction_Style"]
join Thorinn leftmost
join Malrik rightmost
if {Malrik.Trusted_malric} == false:
	Malrik: Even after [i]all[/i] those troubles you've gone through, we've come full circle. You're back asking me for help.
	Malrik: I can see that you've managed to get your hands on [i]my[/i] book, you must've figured out the price of the antidote.
	Malrik: You'll see it would've been better to [b]listen[/b] to my advice. I'm curious what path the [i]glorious[/i] doctor will take.
elif {Malrik.Trusted_malric} == true:
	Malrik: I see you've managed to collect all the papilora flowers. You've only half succeeded because that's only the easy part of the antidote.
Malrik: Now, who will you sacrifice?
- Vivian
	[signal arg="start_night"]
	[wait time="2.0"]
	update Malrik (invis)
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join left_Malrik left [z_index="-1"]
	join vivian rightmost
	Thorinn (agitated): I’m sorry, Vivian.
	update vivian (invis)
	set {Dead_person_choice} = 1
- Marcellus
	[signal arg="start_night"]
	[wait time="2.0"]
	update Malrik (invis)
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join left_Malrik left [z_index="-1"]
	join Nick rightmost
	Thorinn: This ends tonight!
	update Nick (invis)
	set {Dead_person_choice} = 2
- Astrid
	[signal arg="start_night"]
	[wait time="2.0"]
	update Malrik (invis)
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join left_Malrik left [z_index="-1"]
	join Astrid rightmost
	Astrid: What are you doing here in the middle of the night?
	Thorinn (agitated): I’m sorry, I don't have any other choice.
	update Astrid (invis)
	set {Dead_person_choice} = 3
- Don’t kill anyone
	Thorinn: I can’t do this. There must be another way.
	Malrik: Let it be your way then.
	[signal arg="start_night"]
	[wait time="2.0"]
	set {Dead_person_choice} = 4
[signal arg="Final_reveal"]
[signal arg="change_to_day_light"]
update left_Malrik (invis)
[wait time="2.0"]
[signal arg="end-night"]
[wait time="2.0" hide_text="false"]
Thorinn (surprised): Seems like there's quite some ruckus over at the town square.
